{"seq":2,"slug":"implementation","title":"插桩与实现","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"opentelemetry-sdk","title":"OpenTelemetry SDK 架构与生产配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/implementation/opentelemetry-sdk","wordCount":1057,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"otel-collector-pipeline","title":"OTel Collector 管道编排：Receiver-Processor-Exporter","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/implementation/otel-collector-pipeline","wordCount":892,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"ebpf-auto-instrumentation","title":"eBPF 零代码自动插桩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/implementation/ebpf-auto-instrumentation","wordCount":1384,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"插桩与实现\">插桩与实现</h1><p>本章从三个维度覆盖分布式追踪的落地实现：OpenTelemetry SDK 的手动/自动插桩与 TracerProvider 架构、OTel Collector 的 Receiver-Processor-Exporter 管道编排、以及基于 eBPF 的零代码自动插桩技术。三种方式各有适用场景——SDK 给予最精细的业务语义控制，Collector 提供统一的数据路由与治理，eBPF 则以内核级观测实现真正的零侵入。工程师通常在生产中组合使用这三者。</p>\n"}